DD-S007 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-S007)

  × duplicate key `timeout_ms`
    ╭─[20-duplicate-key.yaml:33:5]
 31 │       celsius: { cel: "double(raw) / 100.0", unit: Cel }
 32 │     timeout_ms: 50
    ·     ─────┬────
    ·          ╰── first defined here
 33 │     timeout_ms: 60
    ·     ─────┬────
    ·          ╰── duplicate
 34 │     retries: 2
    ╰────
  help: YAML keeps only one of the values; remove or rename one of them
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[20-duplicate-key.yaml:42:1]
 41 │     timeout_ms: 50
 42 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 43 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
